{{!
    @template mod_syllabus/tab_full_plan

    Tab 1 — "Full plan". The author (caneditcontent) gets the editable weeks/activities
    management UI — with narrative Custom Field autosave, a section-navigation rail and a
    totals bar (mod_syllabus/plan_navigator) — while coordination/admin without that
    capability get the full read-only content (via the shared plan_week_read/
    plan_activity_read/plan_schedule partials, same as the tutor tab's field set) plus
    workflow actions. When canreview, each narrative field's read-only block also gets an
    inline coordinator review-note box directly under it (mod_syllabus/review_note_row) —
    never a separate panel, and never shown at all in the caneditcontent branch (a professor
    who also holds mod/syllabus:review only sees the read-only badge inline via
    narrative_field.mustache, not this editable box).

    Example context (json):
